{"id":1821,"date":"2026-01-06T14:59:36","date_gmt":"2026-01-06T14:59:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/?post_type=jobs&#038;p=1821"},"modified":"2026-01-06T16:17:05","modified_gmt":"2026-01-06T16:17:05","slug":"av-business-development","status":"publish","type":"jobs","link":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/careers\/av-business-development\/","title":{"rendered":"AV Business Development"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p><strong>Job description:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Interactive Displays Ireland is a leading Digital Signage company in Ireland. We have clients across multiple sectors. We have an opportunity for an AV Business Development Executive (Sales)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This is a hybrid remote role. Candidates will need to be at the office 1-2 times a week.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This is a very rewarding role for the right candidate.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Your main responsibilities will include:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Build new clients for our Digital Signage products.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Self generate additional appointments and referrals<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Build, develop and manage a pipeline of potential customers.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Gather and record all client details.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Learn and develop a knowledge of the products available.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Be confident and clear in dealing with potential customers and be able to give advice on solutions suited to their needs.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Be driven within your role and strive to meet set targets.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Self-manage your development through guidance from senior staff in your department.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Overall sales and business development of our digital signage business<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Skills and Qualifications<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Have strong communications skills, both in person and by phone and through email.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Confidient in sales and selling to B2B<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Be enthusiastic and driven to meet targets set by the managers.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Be able to work as part of a team and also on your own initiative.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Be motivated and have good organisation skills.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>One year\u2019s experience in a similar role, preferably in the AV sector.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Have good English equivalent<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Be comfortable using computer programmes i.e. Microsoft outlook, word, sage systems<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Training<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>To support your development, full training will be provided. This will include; product knowledge etc. Commission also available<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Schedule:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Monday to Friday<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Supplemental pay types:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Commission pay<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Ability to commute\/relocate:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Oldcastle, Oldcastle, CO. Meath: reliably commute or plan to relocate before starting work (required)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Experience:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Sales: 1 year (required)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Job Types: Full-time, Permanent<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Additional pay: Commission pay<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1903,"template":"","class_list":["post-1821","jobs","type-jobs","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/jobs\/1821","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/jobs"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/jobs"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/jobs\/1821\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1822,"href":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/jobs\/1821\/revisions\/1822"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-json\/wp